      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "New idea, but it'd take TON of work. Add a code to turn all PC shaders to Standard Lite (with GPU instancing on). >(This will be for the Quest 3 view of PC content only)<\n\nBut, it needs to work through the website, not the SDK. That way we won't have to worry about tryin to migrate from an old SDK, and breakin projects.\n\nThe feature would have to use VRC plus, to keep the number of requests for processing to a minimum. Maybe even put a higher cost subscription for this feature. Call it \"VRC Ultra\" or somethin.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
