      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't know why people ask for \"PC content\" for the quest 3. The additional memory given to the quest 3 is 2 gigabytes of ram. Yeah sure 33% more than 6. \n\nPC only content spans from some avatars needing transparency due to being vroids, to stuff that makes my PC cry out uncle...\n\nShader replacement can be done client side, one of the safety settings on PC is to disallow custom Shaders on avatars. \n\nI guess you could do that with avatars. Worlds would be way more difficult.\n\nIt'll be interesting to see how things change when quest 3 is dominant.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
